1541984,ca.proc.d.1948-06-28.2.5.1.1,1948-06-28,b11f5b30-7d32-44e6-b23c-a24561c1eaf5,ca.m.7719,Right Hon. W. L. MACKENZIE KING (Prime Minister) moved:,Prime Minister; President of the Privy Council,QUESTIONS,NATIONAL CAPITAL,DEVELOPMENT UNDER APPROVED PLAN-PROVISION FOR ANNUAL APPROPRIATIONS,That whereas the requirements of a national capital involve, from time to time, developments of a character beyond the municipal improvements ordinarily required in other cities;
